arty","desc":"Rapper and YouTuber KSI is hosting his first Launch Party exclusively on Roblox where he will be performing 4 of the top tracks from his new album All Over The Place. The performance starts at 4 PM PDT on Friday, August 13th and will be re-air on the hour throughout the weekend! Be sure to explore the whole KSI Launch Party Place where you can:  \r\n\r\n🎤Grab your friends and dance to KSI hits on the boxing ring dance floor \r\n\r\n🏎️Compete with your friends, driving through the streets of London\r\n\r\n🥊Dress up your avatar in KSI-inspired merch\r\n\r\nShowtimes:\r\nFriday 8/13 at 4 PM PDT\r\nThen, every hour on the hour through Sunday 8/15 11 PM PDT","path":"/game/7085418723-ksi-launch-party","slug":"7085418723-ksi-launch-party","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d6ab265526e55195cc409f9a1a5a379dfe45dec124b4243419127dca36858958.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-87249609dae614261c1058785f217b72/150/150/UnapprovedImage/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":41250782,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-21T23:38:12.897Z","creator":{"name":"BMG Production","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":7419509075,"name":"cart ride around used car battery","desc":"in this game you can go around a used car battery and face very interesting situations\n\nUPDATE 1.0.1:\n\nAdded another car battery that you ride around (1.0.0)\nCarts despawn 10 seconds after spawning. (1.0.1)\nCarts despawn if nobody is in them for 20 seconds. (1.0.1)\nRemoved another car battery that you ride around (1.0.2)\n\n","path":"/game/7419509075-cart-ride-around-used-car-battery","slug":"7419509075-cart-ride-around-used-car-battery","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bb2a7c091e59aea5c1800ba1bb16ec7f2fa591aea2872659b921f2ac652f27ed.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bf242d37ae8787ca271e018d77ca4d94/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":15024419,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-17T21:1